event: thinking
data: {"id": "41ab96ae12c348ed-thinking-parallel_evidence-650", "run_id": "41ab96ae12c348ed", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 调查结论\n\n针对 `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` 的调查已完成，事实如下：\n\n*   **状态确认**：Pod 仍处于 `Pending` 状态，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因是 `ImagePullBackOff`。`Restart Count` 为 0，表明容器从未启动过。\n*   **异常原因**：根据 `kubectl_describe` 获取的 Kubernetes Events，错误原文为：`Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`。\n*   **根因定位**：Pod 配置的镜像 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 中的域名 `registry.invalid` 无法解析。这属于**镜像仓库域名不可达（DNS 解析失败）", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788766900979, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "41ab96ae12c348ed-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "41ab96ae12c348ed", "seq": 651, "ts_ms": 1788766909168, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 33.228, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/41ab96ae12c348ed-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "23974c78a20243c3bcdda247c1c1ad9fb2f15a5ca631f5429ffa4232aab1047e", "bytes": 2634}, "snapshot_sha256": "32eb145ac0d9c87a9eeaf2806195ff4d399a7aa9762ffe96ab26142e61b88bc7"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

