data: {"id": "41ab96ae12c348ed-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "41ab96ae12c348ed", "seq": 652, "ts_ms": 1788766909169, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "41ab96ae12c348ed-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "41ab96ae12c348ed", "seq": 653, "ts_ms": 1788766917538, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.37, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1561, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod 配置了无效或无法解析的镜像域名 registry.invalid，导致 kubelet 在拉取镜像时发生 DNS 解析失败，进而使容器处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Failed ... failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` (fact-4cec5d33bed3) | 直接证据：Kubelet 尝试拉取镜像时遭遇 DNS 解析失败，确认域名无效。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Normal BackOff ... Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` (fact-2f9c2a0c5c2f) | 状态证据：Kubelet 因拉取失败持续进入退避阶段，确认故障持续存在。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Failed ImagePullBackOff` (fact-f7daa8c5a151) | 现象证据：Pod 最终状态稳定在 ImagePullBackOff。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason=ImagePullBackOff, fact-0d6756765f58) | 确认：Metric 指标在观测时点确证了容器处于镜像拉取等待状态。 |\n\n**证据小结**：Kubernetes 事件日志与 Prometheus 指标相互印证，均指向同一容器因无法解析 `registry.invalid` 域名而持续拉取失败，处于退避等待状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像配置包含无效域名 registry.invalid → DNS 解析失败 (lookup no such host) → 镜像拉取持续失败并进入 BackOff → Pod 状态 Pending，容器状态 ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 的镜像配置使用了无效且无法解析的域名 `registry.invalid`。\n\n这一配置错误导致 Kubelet 在尝试拉取镜像 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 时，向本地 DNS 服务器 (`127.0.0.53`) 发起查询失败（见证据 #1），进而触发了拉取重试与退避机制（见证据 #2），最终使容器稳定处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（见证据 #3）。Prometheus 指标（证据 #4）进一步确认了该状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod 配置了无效或无法解析的镜像域名 registry.invalid，导致 kubelet 在拉取镜像时发生 DNS 解析失败，进而使容器处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Failed ... failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` (fact-4cec5d33bed3) | 直接证据：Kubelet 尝试拉取镜像时遭遇 DNS 解析失败，确认域名无效。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Normal BackOff ... Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` (fact-2f9c2a0c5c2f) | 状态证据：Kubelet 因拉取失败持续进入退避阶段，确认故障持续存在。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Failed ImagePullBackOff` (fact-f7daa8c5a151) | 现象证据：Pod 最终状态稳定在 ImagePullBackOff。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason=ImagePullBackOff, fact-0d6756765f58) | 确认：Metric 指标在观测时点确证了容器处于镜像拉取等待状态。 |\n\n**证据小结**：Kubernetes 事件日志与 Prometheus 指标相互印证，均指向同一容器因无法解析 `registry.invalid` 域名而持续拉取失败，处于退避等待状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像配置包含无效域名 registry.invalid → DNS 解析失败 (lookup no such host) → 镜像拉取持续失败并进入 BackOff → Pod 状态 Pending，容器状态 ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 的镜像配置使用了无效且无法解析的域名 `registry.invalid`。\n\n这一配置错误导致 Kubelet 在尝试拉取镜像 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 时，向本地 DNS 服务器 (`127.0.0.53`) 发起查询失败（见证据 #1），进而触发了拉取重试与退避机制（见证据 #2），最终使容器稳定处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（见证据 #3）。Prometheus 指标（证据 #4）进一步确认了该状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "41ab96ae12c348ed-final", "run_id": "41ab96ae12c348ed", "seq": 655, "ts_ms": 1788766917548, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod 配置了无效或无法解析的镜像域名 registry.invalid，导致 kubelet 在拉取镜像时发生 DNS 解析失败，进而使容器处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Failed ... failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` (fact-4cec5d33bed3) | 直接证据：Kubelet 尝试拉取镜像时遭遇 DNS 解析失败，确认域名无效。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Normal BackOff ... Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` (fact-2f9c2a0c5c2f) | 状态证据：Kubelet 因拉取失败持续进入退避阶段，确认故障持续存在。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Failed ImagePullBackOff` (fact-f7daa8c5a151) | 现象证据：Pod 最终状态稳定在 ImagePullBackOff。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason=ImagePullBackOff, fact-0d6756765f58) | 确认：Metric 指标在观测时点确证了容器处于镜像拉取等待状态。 |\n\n**证据小结**：Kubernetes 事件日志与 Prometheus 指标相互印证，均指向同一容器因无法解析 `registry.invalid` 域名而持续拉取失败，处于退避等待状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像配置包含无效域名 registry.invalid → DNS 解析失败 (lookup no such host) → 镜像拉取持续失败并进入 BackOff → Pod 状态 Pending，容器状态 ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 的镜像配置使用了无效且无法解析的域名 `registry.invalid`。\n\n这一配置错误导致 Kubelet 在尝试拉取镜像 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 时，向本地 DNS 服务器 (`127.0.0.53`) 发起查询失败（见证据 #1），进而触发了拉取重试与退避机制（见证据 #2），最终使容器稳定处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（见证据 #3）。Prometheus 指标（证据 #4）进一步确认了该状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 59.0s\n├─ 问题定位: 17.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 33.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 33.2s (Evidence 25.2s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 58.981, "metrics": {"run_id": "41ab96ae12c348ed", "mttr": {"value": "59.0s", "seconds": 58.98795175552368, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 58987.95175552368, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 54372.7662563324, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 8692.585229873657, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4176.367998123169}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17369.951486587524, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name"